          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="1252606">TeamDJM</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP764 Birchglen [Found] On our way to Edmonton for the weekend. Quick find once we found our way around the houses and the fences. Had to do a little mud removal. Cap is no longer 10cm AGL - more like 1ft below.. Will post pictures next week, when we get home.

T4TBCP

TeamDJM

Lethbridge Alberta&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;9 Oct 18 - Pics posted.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="686640299">
